-- 13(2)i: Art 13(2) the controller owes the data subject the item of further information
#ASSERT (`Under Article 13(2), as a data subject, where the controller collected my personal data from me, am I entitled to be given the item of further information I name` TRUE `Art 13(2)(a) the period for which the personal data will be stored, or the criteria used to determine that period` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`Under Article 13(2), as a controller, where I collect personal data from the data subject, must I give the data subject the item of further information he or she names` TRUE `Art 13(2)(a) the period for which the personal data will be stored, or the criteria used to determine that period` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT (`Under Article 13(2), as a data subject, where the controller collected my personal data from me, am I entitled to be given the item of further information I name` TRUE `Art 13(2)(c) the existence of the right to withdraw consent at any time, without affecting the lawfulness of processing before its withdrawal` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`Under Article 13(2), as a controller, where I collect personal data from the data subject, must I give the data subject the item of further information he or she names` TRUE `Art 13(2)(c) the existence of the right to withdraw consent at any time, without affecting the lawfulness of processing before its withdrawal` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT (`Under Article 13(2), as a data subject, where the controller collected my personal data from me, am I entitled to be given the item of further information I name` FALSE `Art 13(2)(a) the period for which the personal data will be stored, or the criteria used to determine that period` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`Under Article 13(2), as a controller, where I collect personal data from the data subject, must I give the data subject the item of further information he or she names` FALSE `Art 13(2)(a) the period for which the personal data will be stored, or the criteria used to determine that period` FALSE FALSE FALSE)

-- 13(3): Art 13(3) the controller provides the data subject, prior to the further processing, with information on the other purpose and any relevant further information
#ASSERT (`Under Article 13(3), as a data subject, was I given, before my personal data were further processed for another purpose, information on that purpose and any relevant further information` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`Under Article 13(3), as a controller, where I intend to further process personal data for another purpose, have I provided, before the further processing, information on that purpose and any relevant further information` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
